'''Kingmaker''' is a [[unique]] {{il|Despot Axe}}.

==Mechanics==
{{status
|name=Kingmaker's Presence
|type=Buff
|description=You have Culling Strike, increased item rarity, and additional critical strike multiplier and fortification while near allies using Kingmaker
|bonuses=30% increased Rarity of Items found<br/>Culling Strike<br/>+50% to Critical Strike Multiplier<br/>+10 Fortification}}
Equipping this item grants the ''Kingmaker's Presence'' [[buff]] to nearby [[Ally|allies]]. It does not affect the user. The effects of the buff depends on the version of the Kingmaker, which the pre-3.6.0 legacy item only grant Culling Strike and increased Item Rarity (IIR).

Note that the "nearby" range is very small; it is measured to be a 3 metre radius. Using the [[Meat Shield Support|Meat Shield support]] will keep an [[Animate Guardian]] equipped with the Kingmaker from wandering outside of the player character's range while standing still. When the character walks around however, the Animate Guardian will fall in and out of range to apply Kingmaker's Presence.

{{Item acquisition}}

* Note that when crafting new modifiers will be rolled and values from source items will not stay, unlike in case of [[fated unique item]]s.
* Kingmaker will be a [[Shaper item]] or [[Elder item]] if all inputs are [[Shaper item]]s or [[Elder item]]s respectively. [[Conquerors]]-influence should behave the same.

